      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2011 American Association of Orthodontists. Published by Mosby, Inc. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "This case report describes the successful treatment of an adult patient with skeletal Class II open-bite malocclusion secondary to idiopathic condylar resorption. Total alloplastic joint reconstruction and counterclockwise rotation of the maxillomandibular complex combined with orthodontic treatment provided a satisfying outcome with maximum functional and esthetic improvement."
      },
